:false,"text":"なぜか主人公に心酔しており、主人公がどちらの選択をしてもついてきてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スペックはもの凄く高く、下手に直感に頼る主人公よりもよほど調査能力は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名前は偽名のようだが全て本名。Ｋ６は、ミドルネームと母方と父方の姓名。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｋのうち４つは、命名の際、日本語の名前をつけることに祖父たちが激しく反対したためミドルネームが付いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに誕生時、曾祖父たちの間で発生していた後継者問題の妥協案として、それぞれの姓を個別で継ぐという条件で解決したため、こんなことになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フルネームは、ケンコ・キルスティ・カッリアラ・コイヴラハティ・カタヤイネン・コウノトリ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅館の従業員としては優秀だが、愛想が足りないため裏方仕事が多い。それでも十分優秀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「喰らうがいいのです。ケンコ砲…発射!!　　バァァーーン！（実弾）」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4736","sourceWorkId":"17832","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と一緒に桂城荘へやってきたものの、宿泊費を持たない上司のせいで働かされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか主人公に心酔しており、主人公がどんな選択をしても付いてきてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スペックはもの凄く高く、下手に直感に頼る主人公よりもよほど調査能力は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅館の従業員としては優秀だが、愛想が足りないため裏方仕事が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも十分優秀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大丈夫なのです…。たとえ、あなたがどんな道を選んだとしてもケンコは黙って付いていくのです。それは、あの日に決めた誓いなのです…」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46710"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4736","sourceWorkId":"17832","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"154 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4736","sourceWorkId":"17832","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4736","sourceWorkId":"17832","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4736","sourceWorkId":"17832","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd291334c79a647342daa3b98825c2be29fa332a0bae779ae91e7a329f1316bb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c8daf6794192c7739554279ea21b3e92eb57617d8ea5a7378529f1256722975.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千愛","creatorId":"vndb:s6169","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6169","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6169","name":"千愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49772","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51181","characterName":"雪野 ちとせ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13313","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212672"},{"characterId":"13313","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271211"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4738"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51181"},"originalCharacterName":"雪野 ちとせ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main heroine of the story. She steps in as the young proprietress of the Kinhou-rou, the hot spring inn that the protagonist visits."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the original proprietress eloping with a younger man for the seventh time, Chitose, who happened to be on winter break, is called in to fill the role. Currently a student preparing for her entrance exams, she is under considerable stress, balancing her duties as an innkeeper with her studies, as the exams are less than a month away. Despite her youth, her directions as the proprietress are precise, earning her the respect and fondness of most of the inn's employees. She tends to be stubborn and obstinate when corrected by others, yet she does not resist changing her own opinions. She is somewhat egotistical and determined to thwart the protagonist's lecherous misdeeds at every turn."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51181"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の訪れる温泉の若女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宿の従業員からも、好意的に受け止められている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のスケベな悪事をことごとく邪魔しようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"3375","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"温泉旅館・金峰館の若女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかりものだが根はお人好し。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※「秘湯めぐり～欲情蹂躙温泉記」に登場"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"7682","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【一般宿泊客】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薫の代理人として主人公へ定期的に接触してくる謎の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柳条組のフロント企業・金峰ファイナンスの女社長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"途中からは宿泊客として桂城荘へやってくる。今年で28歳。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"17832","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。主人公の訪れる温泉宿・金峰楼（キンホウロウ）の若女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来の女将が若い男と７回目の蒸発をしてしまったため、たまたま冬休みだった彼女が呼ばれた。現在、受験生。試験まであと１ヶ月ないため、女将の仕事と受験勉強とで、かなりピリピリきている。若いながら、女将としての指図は的確で、宿の従業員からも、一部を除いてかなり好意的に受け止められている。人かのら注意には、頑固で意固地な性格を発揮するが、自分から意見を変えることにはあまり抵抗がない。唯我独尊タイプ。主人公のスケベな悪事をことごとく邪魔しようとする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13313"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"28 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"17832","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/106a9f2a72af7e964d1846a7fa2715625d0bf4f0197fa4d642593495754f9310.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/57f43e2a1380c4bed1ed0775ba87e6bc7c9f6eac57f7b803c8c5f6d23dd4d45b.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"act